.TH geectl-remote-update-package-meta-from-spec 1  "geectl-remote-update-package-meta-from-spec 0.2.2" 
.SH NAME
geectl\-remote\-update\-package\-meta\-from\-spec \- Update a package\*(Aqs meta from its spec file. A mutation: dry\-run is the default (only the plan is printed); `\-\-live` performs the update. The spec file is found by listing the package files when exactly one `*.spec` exists; otherwise name it with `\-\-spec`
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBgeectl remote update\-package\-meta\-from\-spec\fR [\fB\-\-spec\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIPROJECT\fR> <\fIPACKAGE\fR> 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Update a package\*(Aqs meta from its spec file. A mutation: dry\-run is the default (only the plan is printed); `\-\-live` performs the update. The spec file is found by listing the package files when exactly one `*.spec` exists; otherwise name it with `\-\-spec`
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-spec\fR \fI<SPEC>\fR
The spec file to read the meta from
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
<\fIPROJECT\fR>
The project the package lives in
.TP
<\fIPACKAGE\fR>
The package whose meta is updated
.SH VERSION
v0.2.2
